CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract add
^\[add.postcondition.\d+\].*Check ensures clause of contract.*: SUCCESS$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
Function contract verification via DFCC (C syntax).
C++ parser does not yet support __CPROVER_requires/__CPROVER_ensures;
use C files or C++26 pre/post syntax (not yet integrated with DFCC).
